    "role": "student",
    "text": "First tell what has been done and refer to a literature source, then tell what your study aims to do based on what you've told in the previous sentence. What you wrote may cause confusion when reading and the need to reread the paragraph. Proposal how can it look: \"The method of generating synthetic data was proven by ... (there you list the experiments in the paper [3])... . Thus, this study attempts to apply those methods. \"",
