  {
    "id": 3936,
    "user": "Anita Wong",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "what threshold? if your data is going to be very heterogeneous as you mentioned in the previous page, for every criteria (e.g. amount of infected patients, amount of healed patients, etc.) will be different thresholds. Elaborate on this or omit this point to eliminate confusion.",
    "annotationId": 3870,
    "parentCommendId": null,
    "tags": [],
    "votes": [],
    "group": 1
  },
  {
    "id": 3937,
    "user": "Anita Wong",
    "role": "student",
    "text": "Elaborate on exact evaluation method. You can not leave a thought \"open end\" in a scientific proposal.",
    "annotationId": 3871,
    "parentCommendId": null,
    "tags": [],
    "votes": [
      {
        "user": "Shelly Lawrence",
        "role": "assistant",
        "vote": 1
      }
